        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Explain why he is incorrect.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta\\text{ is not opposite the }8$",
          "worked": "$\\theta$ is not opposite the side of length $8$. Each angle must be paired with its opposite side.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 19
      },
      {
        "id": "nr-p17-q7b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Solve for $\\theta$ by finding the missing information first.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$104^\\circ2'$",
          "worked": "Let the top angle be $\\phi$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\sin\\phi}{8}&=\\frac{\\sin35^\\circ}{7}\\\\[8pt]\\sin\\phi&=\\frac{8\\sin35^\\circ}{7}\\\\[8pt]\\phi&=\\sin^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{8\\sin35^\\circ}{7}\\right)\\\\[8pt]\\phi&\\approx40^\\circ58'\\\\[8pt]\\theta&=180^\\circ-35^\\circ-\\sin^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{8\\sin35^\\circ}{7}\\right)\\\\[8pt]\\theta&\\approx104^\\circ2'\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      }
    ]
